;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>When I get back to my seat, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> are making small talk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In front of <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE>, only a glass from the drink bar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems she doesn't plan to eat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She said she was meeting her <STYLE ID="3">sister</STYLE>, so maybe she'll eat after they meet up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, a bit of a cold sweat there..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes, I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Half tuning out the worried words from the two of them, I sit down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ye―"</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<BR>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\選択開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ予知.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\overdose.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment I started to say 'yes,' that alarm bell rings inside me again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That question just now is very dangerous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> called me 'Niimura-san.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never thought she'd ask me something like that out of nowhere, so naturally.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Um, I'm Furumura, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, my mistake again... Your surname's like someone I know, and it just slipped out..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san's</STYLE> words feel a little too deliberate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> eats his food, careful not to meet my eyes or <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san's</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This person</STYLE> is more dangerous than I imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'll keep shaking me with little turns of phrase like that.<PG>
Huh? Wait a second...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could that mean she thinks I'm suspicious?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just from my alias, 'Furumura'?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
No way... I'm overthinking it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She really just mixed up Furumura and Niimura.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That must be it, I tell my instinct.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, heartbreak sure is rough. You do look a little pale, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Which is why, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't go bringing up anything weird, all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I know, okay!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Ugh, isn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> here yet...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Do you have some business with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, we're just having dinner together."</STYLE><PG>
So <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">her sister</STYLE> get along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I get along with <STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE> too, so in that respect I warm to <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> just a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I didn't have a secret like this, I could have thought <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> was a nice person too...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"By the way, how's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> seems to be doing fine, more or less. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Though she says she's taking a break from university and staying away from Motoki-cho until the cherry blossoms fall. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I don't think she'll be coming around here for a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> constitution is a real nuisance too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-san's</STYLE> constitution...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I recall, Kogori-san means <STYLE ID="7">Ryoji-san</STYLE>, the victim of the Motoki-cho case, and his wife, <STYLE ID="8">Akane-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she's a university student, it must mean their daughter, <STYLE ID="10">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> real younger sister.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Part of me would like to meet her, but here I'll talk as little as I can.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Especially in front of <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, but it sounds like she's coming to Motoki-cho tonight!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Today was actually the anniversary of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">her dad's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> death, but it seems she couldn't quite make it work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She gets to Motoki Station before 9 tonight, and she's staying over at my house!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is coming tonight."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like to meet <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-san</STYLE> after all, just a little...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being <STYLE ID="10">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> real younger sister, she'd be a relative of mine too, even without a blood tie.<PG>
But I'd rather have as little to do with <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> as possible, so maybe I'll pass this time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or rather, shouldn't I just finish eating quickly, signal <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> with a look, and part ways with <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> soon?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I twirl more of the slightly cooled peperoncino around my fork than my usual mouthful.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\選択開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ予知.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\overdose.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No way... why...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just taking more noodles is dangerous!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does this... also end up getting <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san's</STYLE> suspicion <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="あお">stoked</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This person</STYLE>... what on earth is she...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I let a little of the noodles drop off my fork, that intuition stops.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Again, a little cold sweat trickles down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just showing signs of wanting to leave quickly, and <STYLE ID="2">this person</STYLE> gets suspicious...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Geez, I can't even eat a meal properly...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you okay? You're still sweating."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah, yes, this is―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\選択開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ予知.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Hold on, you're kidding!? Why is THIS dangerous!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I was going to say was 'the peperoncino's a bit spicy, so I'm sweating'...!<PG>
My instinct tells me―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After I answer that, what <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> will say is,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You can't handle spice enough to sweat, and you ordered peperoncino?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is this maybe your first time eating peperoncino?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Could it be that you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, live somewhere out in the country, with no places like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"And that country would be, maybe..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No good! I have to think of a different way to put it, fast...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I like spicy food and eat it a lot, but I just sweat easily..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, I see. Girls your age have a fast metabolism, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> flashes me a big grin again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Talking with <STYLE ID="2">this person</STYLE> is truly exhausting...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> is the type I could never get along with, no matter how we met.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, today's a good day, isn't it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Having girls like me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> at your side over dinner! A lolicon's dream come true!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Cough, cough...! I'm not a lolicon, I'm...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A devotee of pretty girls, was it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wai...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, my mistake again... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hearing me say something like that would wreck </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> reputation, wouldn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's already too late..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahaha, sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you don't look that surprised. Did you already know, maybe?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why drag me into it...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah, um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stall on my answer and act vague.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anything but a hazy answer like this, and everything scares me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with the conversation this lighthearted, I can't let my guard down for a second.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I mustn't get swept along by where this topic is going.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Argh, come on! Drop that topic, drop it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　No more talk about my hobbies, and none about </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> either!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
False name or not, he called me by my name, just like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That makes me a little happy, but at the same time I can't stop worrying about how long <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san's</STYLE> cheerful onslaught will go on.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh! So you call her '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">,' huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So what if I do! I told you she's a relative..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, no! It's just the first time I've heard you call a girl by just her name, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You two must be really close."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
