<STYLE ID="2">　Well then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'll be going nooow!"</STYLE>
