<BR>
{DELETECG "人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> took her drink bar glass and hurried off with her <STYLE ID="3">sister</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I let out a big sigh and slump over the table.
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm really exhausted... I never want to see <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you all right? Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> can't know why I'm so utterly <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="こんぱい">exhausted</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason I'm this worn down is that I experienced danger sense for the first time, and it came at me again and again <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="どとう">like a raging wave</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even if I explained this to <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, there's no way he'd understand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, it's just... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> eyes scared me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">that girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, believe it or not, is frighteningly smart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Say one odd thing and she'll have you by the tail and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> real identity exposed in no time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... you're already talking, quite naturally, like you know what kind of person I am."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still slumped over the table, I answer weakly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Ah, yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So, just as I thought, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... the whereabouts of </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I can't say right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I figured."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"So you're still not going to draw it out of me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I drew it out of you now, would you tell the truth?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I wouldn't."</STYLE><PG>
I'm still slumped over the table―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm just... tired.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I'll just go back to Arata like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
