<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... I'll go home tomorrow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It's like, this is no time to be scared anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... well, that's for the best."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"If I go home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, will you search the area where my house is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I suppose so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'd rather the suspect turned herself in so I didn't have to."</STYLE><PG>
Is he trying to get me to persuade <STYLE ID="14">Auntie</STYLE> to turn herself in?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If not, the police will come to the Arata settlement again...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time they'll investigate on the assumption that <STYLE ID="15">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="16">Mommy</STYLE> are hiding her too, and they won't miss anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Um, if the police try to catch the culprit, won't she just get away again?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　I mean, the culprit's been on the run for 4 years, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right, that's my biggest worry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When they disappeared 4 years ago, too, they jumped off the roof of a five-story apartment building, and mother and daughter both vanished."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"From the fifth floor...!?"</STYLE><PG>
Even I wouldn't come away unharmed from jumping off a fifth floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet <STYLE ID="14">Auntie</STYLE> jumped holding <STYLE ID="10">Haruka-chan</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way something like magic could...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"How they managed to disappear like that is still a complete mystery, even now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They vanished as if they'd been sucked smoothly into another dimension. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, when people vanish like that, even the police don't feel like investigating forever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I give up, this case is buried in the dark for good."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So you mean you're the one leading that case now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, nominally. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Back then someone higher up was in command, but even so there were no results, and now it's just me, plodding along with the investigation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, rather than 'leading,' maybe 'stubbornness' is the better word. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">My men have pretty much given up, too."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this moment, one idea comes to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason I'd lose my place to belong is that sooner or later the police will investigate the Arata settlement, and <STYLE ID="15">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="16">Mommy</STYLE> might be arrested.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's exactly one way to prevent that.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, right in front of me, just has to stop investigating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the police will never set foot in the Arata settlement, and I won't have to worry about my place to belong being torn up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But by the looks of it, he won't give up that easily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems that <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> is supporting Ise-san, and they're keeping the investigation going as a small elite team.<PG>
How can I get <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> to give up?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, not only that, but I have to get <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> to give up too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>, someone who isn't even here, to give up too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to remove everything that motivates <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
But I can't stay long in Motoki-cho either, and even taking the drive out of that <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> alone is probably beyond me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
