<STYLE ID="10">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">―there's no way I'm handing her over!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, come home! There's no way you can get away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, I've changed since I came here. </STYLE>
