<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! You can't!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"That's why...! That's why, just go home...!</STYLE>
