<STYLE ID="10">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, I'm sorry, but I can't leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> alone."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the culprit of the Megasawa City case, and the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Besides... do you know how </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">you, Niimura-senpai,</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> are related?"</STYLE>
