<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"I intend to stay with </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> forever. </STYLE>
